tests/testthat/fixtures
-----------------------

The example documents and data in tests/testthat/fixtures are copied from the
mlcommons/croissant repository (https://github.com/mlcommons/croissant) at
commit ec24358: copyright MLCommons Association and contributors, licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0, included as
tests/testthat/fixtures/LICENSE-croissant.md. tests/testthat/fixtures/README.md
gives the source path of each file. mlcroissant-warnings.json and README.md in
that directory are part of croissant.

Some of these files hold content from third-party datasets, as the upstream
repository distributes it:

- datasets/1.0/coco2014-mini/data/captions_train2014.json and
  instances_train2014.json: excerpts of the COCO 2014 captions and instance
  annotations, copyright COCO Consortium (https://cocodataset.org), licensed
  under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 License. The images in
  train2014.zip are 3 x 2 pixel placeholders.
- datasets/1.0/pass-mini/data/pass_metadata.csv: rows of the metadata of the
  PASS dataset (Asano et al., 2021, https://zenodo.org/record/6615455),
  licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 License; each row names
  the Flickr user and the license of an image. The images in PASS.0.tar and
  PASS.1.tar are 3 x 2 pixel placeholders.
- datasets/1.0/titanic/data/titanic.csv: the Titanic passenger data of
  OpenML dataset 40945 (https://www.openml.org/d/40945), compiled by Thomas
  Cason from the Encyclopedia Titanica, declared in its metadata under the
  Academic Free License 3.0.
- datasets/1.0/audio_test/data/Clap.mp3 and Snap.mp3: audio clips whose
  source the upstream repository does not state.
- 1.0/huggingface-*.json and 1.1/huggingface-*.json: metadata that the
  Hugging Face Hub generates for datasets on the Hub; their descriptions are
  taken from each dataset's card, written by the dataset's authors.
